        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-23T00:02:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;josul0215&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"josul0215\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Wait, there’s official games and tournaments? Where? When?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Not yet - they’re working on some ideas for conventions, though.</p>\n<p>I think it’s more of an issue of showing up at a place where other folks are playing, such as at a game store - especially if you’re lucky enough to have one of the &gt;G folks show up in your area.</p>",
