        "created_at": "2012-05-23T17:36:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, luck is a big factor. Me and my friend Tom played the other day using 2 heroes each against Voss and we got slaughtered. We are both veterans of everything from MTG through D&amp;D and Arkham Horror. That said Voss and the enviroment (Rook City) teamed up to just crush us, and my other character (Absolute Zero) just never picked up any speed.</p>",
