      {
        "id": 31030,
        "name": "Vyolynce",
        "username": "Vyolynce",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/vyolynce/{size}/2397_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-23T19:18:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;lugaru&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"lugaru\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yeah, luck is a big factor. Me and my friend Tom played the other day using 2 heroes each against Voss and we got slaughtered. We are both veterans of everything from MTG through D&amp;D and Arkham Horror. That said Voss and the enviroment (Rook City) teamed up to just crush us, and my other character (Absolute Zero) just never picked up any speed.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Wow. And neither Voss nor RC have cards that specifically mess with AZ’s stuff, too. That was just unfortunate. I generally love whenever I have an equipment-oriented character and we randomly pull out Voss.</p>",
